{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;The Rules Kaidan: Night Watch&quot;</strong> is a side-scrolling horror adventure game. In the game, you become the protagonist of these strange rules, navigating a world teeming with supernatural creatures. Your survival in this dangerous realm hinges on <strong>meticulously adhering to every single rule</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you forget, death will be your teacher...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929660/extras/49349638253678102e110a72a38fd556.poster.avif?t=1766226786\" width=1078 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929660/extras/49349638253678102e110a72a38fd556.webm?t=1766226786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929660/extras/49349638253678102e110a72a38fd556.mp4?t=1766226786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Obey the Rules, the Only Path to Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Understand and memorize the distinct rules of each world, as they can sometimes be completely opposite. Never enter the realm of rule-based anomalies with a habitual mindset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even when your soul trembles and your heart nearly stops, remember this: <strong>obeying the rules is your only way out</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929660/extras/ba8500c7738f3e70878d9571eabc0fe9.avif?t=1766226786\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chase and Evade, Life Hanging by a Thread</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death does not visit when you are fully prepared.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one will passively wait for you to reveal a flaw forever, and neither will they. As the exploration deepens, the night devours the last shred of sanity, and indescribable entities will actively seek your presence.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between pursuit and flight, fear can easily overpower reason. In such moments, can you still recall <strong>the one rule that can protect you</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929660/extras/c5c5529002b8dd3af5a1256699903a9d.poster.avif?t=1766226786\" width=1078 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929660/extras/c5c5529002b8dd3af5a1256699903a9d.webm?t=1766226786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929660/extras/c5c5529002b8dd3af5a1256699903a9d.mp4?t=1766226786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Iceberg Topples, Strange Tales Emerge</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear is humanity's most primal and instinctive emotion. After we built a great modern civilization with reason and courage, did those spine-chilling entities vanish without a trace? Or do they lurk beneath the iceberg, waiting to devour the next curious soul?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We drew inspiration from countless urban legends and modern eerie tales - <strong>phantom buses, sprinting mannequins, the cat-faced old woman</strong>... Any of them could become part of the world of rule-based horror, awaiting your arrival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929660/extras/09105961ffad796503003c92d679d639.poster.avif?t=1766226786\" width=1078 height=512 ><so